coder › Implemented `wrap(text, width)` on branch `work/wrap`.

What changed:
- `src/wrap.ts`: replaced the `not implemented` stub with a greedy word-wrap. Paragraphs are split on blank lines, words on `/\s+/` (runs of spaces/tabs collapse), lines packed to at most `width` chars breaking at spaces, over-long words chunked across lines, paragraphs joined with one blank line, and `width < 1` throws `RangeError`.
- `src/wrap.test.ts` (new): 7 tests covering line length/space breaks, space-run collapsing, long-word splitting, paragraph separation/collapsing to one blank line, no trailing spaces, `RangeError` on `width < 1`, empty/blank input.

